#. module: l10n_ca_ab_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_ab_payroll.source_workers_compensation_act
msgid ""
"The Board assesses employers on a percentage of the payroll or another rate "
"it chooses (s. 97); net earnings above an amount prescribed by order of the "
"Board are not taken into account (s. 56(18))."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_ab_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_ab_payroll.source_wcb_annual_returns
msgid ""
"The annual return reports the assessable earnings paid in the year just "
"ended and estimates those of the current year; filed online from January 1 "
"to February 28."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_ab_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_ab_payroll.source_t4032ab_2026
msgid ""
"Two worked examples that the tests reproduce: 1,300 a week with an RRSP of "
"80, 170.20 of tax; 1,600 a week above the YMPE with a TD1AB claim of 60,000,"
" 210.18 of tax, of which the Alberta supplemental tax credit of 2% of the "
"credit amounts above 61,200 (68.85 a year)."
msgstr ""

